cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below."
title: "Analysis code and data for: admission 25-hydroxyvitamin D and functional outcome after hypertensive intracerebral haemorrhage"
abstract: >-
  R analysis code and the de-identified analytic data set (n = 90) reproducing
  every number, table and figure reported in the accompanying prospective cohort
  study of admission serum 25-hydroxyvitamin D and 90-day modified Rankin Scale
  outcome after hypertensive intracerebral haemorrhage.
type: software
license: MIT
